  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Chou Jiu later says he and his senior sister Chen Jiu cultivated together and entered deep into the Door of Life and Death, capturing life Gu and death Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          385
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "chen-jiu-capture",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In that telling, Wisdom Gu directs Desolate Ancient Moon to a still blue sea that is the source of all living beings, with many life Gu in its depths. A human shaped life Gu brought to shore can bestow a new life, but staying over fifteen minutes assimilates the entrant into the sea. The siblings find life Gu packed there like blue gems of many sizes and shapes, including animal forms that can turn into living creatures on shore, but no human shaped life Gu. Desolate Ancient Moon states that people themselves were formed from life Gu, and she chooses assimilation so she can return as a human shaped life Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          591
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
